{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to GNU C++11 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to GNU C++11 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.lang.*;\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Cutting{\n\n    public static int[]strToIntArr(String s){\n        String[] sArr = s.split(\" \");\n        int len = sArr.length;\n        int[] retArr = new int[len];\n        for(int i=0;i<len;i++){\n            retArr[i] = Integer.parseInt(sArr[i]);\n        }\n        return retArr;\n    }\n\n    boolean checkSub(int[]aArr,int splitInd){\n        int nEven = 0;\n        int nOdd = 0;\n        for(int i=0;i<=splitInd;i++){\n            if((aArr[i]%2)==0) nEven++;\n            else nOdd++;\n        }\n        return nEven==nOdd;\n    }\n\n    int getMaxCuts(int n, int b, int[]aArr){\n        List<Integer> remaining = new ArrayList<Integer>();\n        for(int i=1;i<aArr.length-1;i++){\n            if(checkSub(aArr,i)){\n                remaining.add(i);\n            }\n        }\n        int nCoins = b;\n        int nCuts = 0;\n        while(nCoins>0 && !remaining.isEmpty()){\n            int bestCost = nCoins + 1;\n            int bestPos = -1;\n            for(int j=0;j<remaining.size();j++){\n                int idx = remaining.get(j);\n                int cost = Math.abs(aArr[idx]-aArr[idx+1]);\n                if(cost < bestCost){\n                    bestCost = cost;\n                    bestPos = j;\n                }\n            }\n            if(bestPos==-1) break;\n            remaining.remove(bestPos);\n            nCoins -= bestCost;\n            nCuts++;\n        }\n        return nCuts;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[]args) throws Exception{\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        BufferedWriter bw = new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(System.out));\n        String nbLn = br.readLine();\n        String aLn =  br.readLine();\n        int[]nbArr = strToIntArr(nbLn);\n        int[]aArr = strToIntArr(aLn);\n        Cutting cut = new Cutting();\n        int n = nbArr[0];\n        int b = nbArr[1];\n        int maxC = cut.getMaxCuts(n,b,aArr);\n        bw.write(Integer.toString(maxC));\n        bw.newLine();\n        bw.flush();\n    }\n\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\n#include <cstdlib>\n#include <algorithm>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nvector<int> strToIntArr(const string& s) {\n    vector<int> ret;\n    istringstream iss(s);\n    int num;\n    while (iss >> num) {\n        ret.push_back(num);\n    }\n    return ret;\n}\n\nbool checkSub(const vector<int>& aArr, int splitInd) {\n    int nEven = 0;\n    int nOdd = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i <= splitInd; ++i) {\n        if (aArr[i] % 2 == 0) nEven++;\n        else nOdd++;\n    }\n    return nEven == nOdd;\n}\n\nint getMaxCuts(int n, int b, const vector<int>& aArr) {\n    vector<int> remaining;\n    for (int i = 1; i < (int)aArr.size() - 1; ++i) {\n        if (checkSub(aArr, i)) {\n            remaining.push_back(i);\n        }\n    }\n    int nCoins = b;\n    int nCuts = 0;\n    while (nCoins > 0 && !remaining.empty()) {\n        int bestCost = nCoins + 1;\n        int bestPos = -1;\n        for (int j = 0; j < (int)remaining.size(); ++j) {\n            int idx = remaining[j];\n            int cost = abs(aArr[idx] - aArr[idx + 1]);\n            if (cost < bestCost) {\n                bestCost = cost;\n                bestPos = j;\n            }\n        }\n        if (bestPos == -1) break;\n        remaining.erase(remaining.begin() + bestPos);\n        nCoins -= bestCost;\n        nCuts++;\n    }\n    return nCuts;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    string nbLn, aLn;\n    getline(cin, nbLn);\n    getline(cin, aLn);\n    vector<int> nbArr = strToIntArr(nbLn);\n    vector<int> aArr = strToIntArr(aLn);\n    int n = nbArr[0];\n    int b = nbArr[1];\n    int maxC = getMaxCuts(n, b, aArr);\n    cout << maxC << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-9.536738616588991e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0004368066438473761, -0.00035661060246638954, -5.483612312673358e-06, -0.003195776604115963, -1.2993727978027891e-05, 0.0, 0.0, -0.6692283153533936, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.5769513845443726, -5.483612312673358e-06, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.00013815402053296566, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.777537883957848e-05, -4.768360213347478e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.4560272693634033, -6.437280717364047e-06, -0.3162458837032318, -0.20141606032848358, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.47835975885391235, -0.10070738941431046, -0.0032504366245120764, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -0.005345100536942482, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -8.34461570775602e-06, -6.198863957251888e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -0.0015025765169411898, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.0052339909598231316, -7.152555099310121e-07, -2.5987286790041253e-05, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -0.0065442295745015144, 0.0, 